OL,3,GNEWSANo child should have to learn in a
OL,4,Acold classroom - children's
OL,5,Acommissioner
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo child should be expected to learn in
OL,8,Fa cold classroom because of budget
OL,9,Fpressures, according to Northern
OL,10,FIreland's commissioner for children.
OL,12,FChris Quinn was speaking after it
OL,13,Femerged that staff and pupils at
OL,14,Fschools across Northern Ireland have
OL,15,Fbeen told to "wear more clothes" to cut
OL,16,Fheating bills.
OL,18,FSchools have been told by the Education
OL,19,FAuthority (EA) that increasing costs
OL,20,Fwill affect school energy bills and to
OL,21,Freduce heating and lighting "wherever
OL,22,Fpossible".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
