OL,3,GNEWSANo child should have to learn in a
OL,4,Acold classroom - children's
OL,5,Acommissioner
OL,6,
OL,7,FQuinn said: "Children should not be
OL,8,Fleft to pick up the pieces of a problem
OL,9,Fthat they did not create".
